{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在部分关键心理转折上不如X解释得充分，尤其S08暖意为何消散、S12为何不再责怪自己。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句和放大关键词让观众能边听边迅速抓住每段核心，感受按音乐进程出现，也使细微变化更容易与具体时刻对应，而不是同时面对一堆难以归位的感受。X的优势是心理因果更完整，尤其能解释人物为什么从一种心情转向另一种，但较长的叙述与同时铺开的感受增加了观看负担。Y虽然牺牲了少量心理解释，却更容易让普通观众在有限时间里跟住从离开、怀念、动摇到逐渐自主决定的整条线。\"\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "41d7c04e-6206-42e2-a876-b8fc18545db6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060554640434Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.093, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:07:01.759116+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "85e66b893094327f5d4b2d383a9a445bef9410bd4613ae7a9ddfb15ed91b81d4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23